@startuml ABU-SSO Class / ERD
title ABU-SSO — Class Diagram / Entity Relationship Diagram

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold

class User {
  + id : str <<PK, UUID>>
  --
  email : str <<unique, indexed>>
  password_hash : str
  full_name : str
  role : str  {student | staff | admin}
  matric_no : str <<indexed>>
  is_active : bool
  created_at : datetime
  --
  + __repr__()
}

class Wallet {
  + id : str <<PK, UUID>>
  --
  user_id : str <<FK → User.id, unique, indexed>>
  balance : Decimal(10,2)
  created_at : datetime
  --
  + __repr__()
}

class Transaction {
  + id : str <<PK, UUID>>
  --
  wallet_id : str <<FK → Wallet.id, indexed>>
  amount : Decimal(10,2)
  type : str  {credit | debit}
  description : str
  created_at : datetime
  --
  + __repr__()
}

User "1" -- "0..1" Wallet : owns >
Wallet "1" -- "0..*" Transaction : contains >

note right of User
  A User has exactly
  zero or one Wallet.
  The Wallet is created
  lazily on first access.
end note

note right of Wallet
  Deleting a Wallet
  cascades to its
  Transactions.
end note

@enduml